    "title": "LazyLinear reports in_features=0 after loading initialized state and running forward",
    "body": "After torch.nn.LazyLinear loads the state of an initialized Linear, its first forward produces the expected output shape and converts it to Linear but leaves in_features at zero. The converted module must report the input width from the loaded weight and reject a first input whose width conflicts with that state, while ordinary lazy initialization remains unchanged.",
